WEBVTT

NOTE Brats (1930) - Riah TV captions

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.500
[music]

00:04:27.420 --> 00:04:28.720
Go to bed.

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:43.880
Sing.

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:13.980
Remember the old adage.

00:08:14.980 --> 00:08:18.850
You can lead a horse to water,
but a pencil must be led.

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:24.100
I guess you're right.

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:26.880
Now listen,

00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:32.400
first one undressed and
to bed gets that nickel.

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:40.070
Goodbye.

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:41.420
See?

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:49.520
What a little bit
of kindness will do?

00:08:51.070 --> 00:08:52.370
You're right.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:56.050
A little kindness
goes a long way.

00:12:51.720 --> 00:12:53.020
My break.

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:56.540
My break. My break. You
went in the pocket there.

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:09.580
Will you go to sleep?

00:18:19.470 --> 00:18:20.770
Sing for me.

00:18:27.000 --> 00:20:01.800
[singing a lullaby:
"Go to sleep, my baby"]

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:19.800
If I

00:20:24.930 --> 00:20:27.590
give you a drink of water,
will you go to sleep?

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:34.050
Just a moment.

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:37.320
You might spill it.
